<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取学习记录…</view><block wx:elif="{{student}}"><view class="eyebrow">STUDENT PROGRESS</view><view class="title">{{student.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{student.studentNo}} · {{student.className}}</view><view class="spacer"/><view class="card"><view class="metric-grid"><view class="metric"><text class="metric-value">{{stats.learned}}</text><text class="metric-label">已学词数</text></view><view class="metric"><text class="metric-value">{{stats.due}}</text><text class="metric-label">到期复习</text></view></view><view class="divider"/><view class="row small"><text>今日听写答对 / 核对次数</text><text class="link">{{stats.dictationCorrect}} / {{stats.dictationCount}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="list-title">单词学习记录</view><view wx:if="{{!words.length}}" class="empty">尚无已同步的背词记录。</view><view wx:for="{{words}}" wx:key="wordId" class="list-item"><view class="row"><text class="record-word">{{item.word}}</text><text class="badge">自评：{{item.ratingLabel}}</text></view><view class="muted small">练习 {{item.reviews}} 次 · 遗忘反馈 {{item.lapses}} 次</view><view class="muted small">下次复习 {{item.dueLabel}}</view></view></view></block><view wx:else class="empty">暂时无法读取这位学生的记录。</view></view>
